      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I havent tested this with anyone oculus yet, but the new steamvr bindings might fix some issues with people on pcvr.\n\ni dont know yet if oculus's triggers have gestureweight implemented onto them if the gesture weight is used on trigger instead of grip.\n\nbut that Would fix most problems with most of the pcvr community, unfortunately the quest-only users dont have steamvr bindings.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    }
